#. Description of the plugin
#: fraudnova.php:5
msgid "Scores the IP address, phone number and email of every new WooCommerce order and holds risky cash-on-delivery orders for review. Blocks throwaway emails and abusive traffic on registration and Contact Form 7 forms."
msgstr ""

